{"vid": "UFcb-XF1RPQ", "source": "deepgram", "model": "nova-3", "translation_model": "pool:[\"antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash\",\"codex/gpt-6-luna\",\"trae-cn/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"workbuddy-vps/cn:deepseek-v4.1-flash\"]", "translation_models": ["codex/gpt-6-luna", "antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash", "trae-cn/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "workbuddy-vps/cn:deepseek-v4.1-flash"], "translation_workers": {"codex/gpt-6-luna": 50, "antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash": 50, "trae-cn/deepseek-v4.1-flash": 20, "workbuddy-vps/cn:deepseek-v4.1-flash": 30}, "cues": [{"s": 12.0, "e": 13.6, "en": "I obviously made a mistake.", "zh": "显然我犯了个错误。"}, {"s": 17.5, "e": 18.86, "en": "I made a mistake.", "zh": "我犯了个错误。"}, {"s": 20.55, "e": 21.66, "en": "I trusted.", "zh": "我信任了。"}, {"s": 23.59, "e": 24.79, "en": "I believed.", "zh": "我相信了。"}, {"s": 27.5, "e": 27.82, "en": "Family.", "zh": "家族。"}, {"s": 32.35, "e": 37.71, "en": "Maybe a mafia family. You turn your back and you get whacked. Our guys come back from Japan", "zh": "也许是黑手党家族。你一转身就会被干掉。我们的人从日本回来"}, {"s": 38.51, "e": 39.95, "en": "with this NEC,", "zh": "带着这台NEC，"}, {"s": 41.07, "e": 44.91, "en": "and it's loaded with Microsoft programs. Your Microsoft programs,", "zh": "里面装满了微软的程序。你们的微软程序，"}, {"s": 46.15, "e": 48.15, "en": "They're almost identical to ours.", "zh": "它们和我们的几乎一模一样。"}, {"s": 52.06, "e": 54.06, "en": "There may be some similarities, Steve.", "zh": "可能有一些相似之处，Steve。"}, {"s": 57.98, "e": 58.7, "en": "Similarities.", "zh": "相似之处。"}, {"s": 63.13, "e": 64.25, "en": "Similarities.", "zh": "相似之处。"}, {"s": 67.53, "e": 68.65, "en": "Try theft.", "zh": "那叫偷窃。"}, {"s": 68.89, "e": 74.81, "en": "Steve, all cars have steering wheels, but no one tries to claim that the steering wheel was their invention. We have a contract,", "zh": "Steve，所有车都有方向盘，但没人试图声称方向盘是自己的发明。我们有合同，"}, {"s": 75.67, "e": 78.06, "en": "and I. Well, you should read it more carefully.", "zh": "而我。嗯，你应该更仔细地读一读。"}, {"s": 78.47, "e": 79.42, "en": "What is this?", "zh": "这是什么？"}, {"s": 80.62, "e": 82.7, "en": "This is like doing business with them,", "zh": "这就像跟他们做生意，"}, {"s": 83.27, "e": 87.5, "en": "like a praying mantis, You get seduced and then eaten alive afterwards.", "zh": "就像螳螂一样，你被诱惑上钩，然后被活活吃掉。"}, {"s": 88.06, "e": 89.19, "en": "Get real, will you?", "zh": "你清醒点行不行？"}, {"s": 92.1, "e": 95.46, "en": "You and I are both like guys that had this rich neighbor,", "zh": "你我都像是有个有钱的邻居，"}, {"s": 96.58, "e": 97.54, "en": "Xerox,", "zh": "施乐，"}, {"s": 98.34, "e": 100.42, "en": "that left the door open all the time", "zh": "总是敞着门，"}, {"s": 100.82, "e": 103.7, "en": "and you go sneaking in to steal a TV set.", "zh": "于是你就偷偷溜进去，想偷台电视。"}, {"s": 104.42, "e": 105.46, "en": "Only when you get there,", "zh": "可你到了那儿才发现，"}, {"s": 106.38, "e": 107.5, "en": "you realize", "zh": "我已经先到了。"}, {"s": 107.81, "e": 110.61, "en": "that I got there first. I got the loot, Steve.", "zh": "我拿到赃物了，史蒂夫。"}, {"s": 111.97, "e": 113.25, "en": "And you're yelling?", "zh": "你还在那儿嚷嚷？"}, {"s": 113.9, "e": 115.33, "en": "That's not fair.", "zh": "这不公平。"}, {"s": 116.69, "e": 118.38, "en": "I wanted to try to steal it first.", "zh": "我本来也想先试着偷的。"}, {"s": 125.39, "e": 126.43, "en": "You're too late.", "zh": "你来得太晚了。"}, {"s": 133.97, "e": 135.66, "en": "We're better than you are.", "zh": "我们比你们更优秀。"}, {"s": 141.18, "e": 142.62, "en": "We have better stuff.", "zh": "我们的东西更好。"}, {"s": 143.01, "e": 144.46, "en": "You don't get it, Steve.", "zh": "你还是没搞懂，Steve。"}, {"s": 146.46, "e": 147.5, "en": "That doesn't matter.", "zh": "那些根本无关紧要。"}]}